endobj

170 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 110 0 R/E(It gives me immense pleasure to introduce Meraki: Echoes of Olympus, the latest edition by the Crescent Literary Society. This publication reflects the society\220s enthusiasm and ability to draw inspiration from timeless sources while presenting them through fresh and engaging perspectives.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

171 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 110 0 R/E(The collective effort of the contributors is clearly visible in the compelling narratives, artwork, and visual presentation of the magazine. Such teamwork and dedication not only strengthen the publication but also leave a lasting impression on the readers.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

172 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 110 0 R/E(I congratulate the entire team for bringing out yet another impressive edition of Meraki and encourage everyone to take the time to explore and enjoy this creative anthology.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

