265 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 113 0 R/E(CLS felt like a second home. The people were welcoming and didn't judge based on behaviour or characteristics\204well, maybe just a little if you did something truly outrageous. Overall, they accepted me for who I am and even saw potential in me, appointing me as the wildcard for the Editor-in-Chief position, for which I was genuinely grateful.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[3]>>
