<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 130 0 R/T(Antigone: The Rebel Who Died for What Was Right Antigone had neither power nor divinity. She was a young woman with no army or crown, possessing only that which makes one truly strong: conviction.)/E(Antigone: The Rebel Who Died for What Was Right Antigone had neither power nor divinity. She was a young woman with no army or crown, possessing only that which makes one truly strong: conviction.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[5]>>
