<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 135 0 R/T(The Takeaway Greek mythology\220s women weren\220t footnotes\204they were the story. Their \215villainy\216 was often just a refusal to fit into a box. Today, authors, artists, and even TikTokers are giving them new life, not as monsters or martyrs, but as mentors.)/E(The Takeaway Greek mythology\220s women weren\220t footnotes\204they were the story. Their \215villainy\216 was often just a refusal to fit into a box. Today, authors, artists, and even TikTokers are giving them new life, not as monsters or martyrs, but as mentors.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[0]>>
