545 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 135 0 R/T(So next time you hear these myths, listen closer. Medusa\220s snakes are whispering, \215Protect your peace.\216 Pandora\220s jar is saying, \215Hope is a superpower.\216 And Clytemnestra\220s blade is a reminder that love doesn\220t always play nice.)/E(So next time you hear these myths, listen closer. Medusa\220s snakes are whispering, \215Protect your peace.\216 Pandora\220s jar is saying, \215Hope is a superpower.\216 And Clytemnestra\220s blade is a reminder that love doesn\220t always play nice.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[1]>>
