<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 148 0 R/E(The extravaganza was a massive collaborative effort, with numerous student clubs contributing to its success through captivating dance showcases, martial arts displays, and meticulous event management. This synergy between student organisers and celebrity guests created an electrifying atmosphere for the vibrant crowd. Orion\22025 concluded as a resounding success, delivering a memorable and exciting celebration of campus talent and culture for all attendees.)/Pg 48 0 R/K[11]>>
