<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 150 0 R/E(CresCon\22025, a national-level convention conducted by the Student Council, was held from 22nd to 24th April 2025. Designed to foster innovation and professional growth, the three-day event brought together students, educators, and industry leaders. Key highlights included an inspiring fireside chat on mental health by founder Ms. Pooja Srinivasa Raja and an \215Entrepreneurship Unplugged\216 panel discussion where startup founders shared lessons on resilience and negotiation.)/Pg 50 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

757 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 150 0 R/E(The convention also featured hands-on workshops on emerging technologies like AI and Augmented Reality, alongside the vibrant CresCon\22025 Expo with its diverse stalls and celebrity appearances. The event was a resounding success, creating an engaging atmosphere for knowledge sharing and collaboration. CresCon\22025 effectively provided a valuable platform for personal and professional development, leaving a lasting impression on all attendees.)/Pg 50 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

