2231 0 obj
<</Title(Why These Stories Matter Today These myths aren\220t ancient history\204they\220re blueprints that show how stories shape power. For centuries, women were cast as villains or victims to uphold patriarchal norms. But retellings do more than \215fix\216 myths; they reclaim the right to be complicated.)/Dest[34 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2233 0 R/Next 2229 0 R>>
endobj

2232 0 obj
<</Title(ART CORNER)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2230 0 R/First 2234 0 R/Last 2234 0 R/Count -1/Next 2235 0 R>>
