2243 0 obj
<</Title(Because hope is dangerous. Hope means people might question the gods, rebel, or rewrite their fate. Natalie Haynes\220s book Pandora\220s Jar reframes her: What if Pandora wasn\220t naive, but curious? What if opening the jar wasn\220t a mistake, but an act of bravery? Today, she\220s a symbol of resilience\204not a scapegoat, but the first woman daring enough to seek answers.)/Dest[33 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2246 0 R/Next 2240 0 R>>
endobj

2244 0 obj
<</Title(GODS VS. PROPHECIES: HOW THE GODS TRIED TO CHEAT FATE \(AND FAILED MISERABLY\))/Dest[26 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2242 0 R>>
